E-Commerce Sales Data Analysis Using Microsoft Excel

Project Overview

This project analyses e-commerce sales data using Microsoft Excel to identify revenue trends, product category performance, store performance, and customer payment preferences.

Project Objectives

- Analyse total sales revenue.
- Identify top-performing product categories.
- Compare sales across stores.
- Analyse customer payment methods.
- Build an interactive Excel dashboard.

Tools and Skills

- Microsoft Excel
- Data Cleaning
- Excel Formulas
- PivotTables
- PivotCharts
- Slicers
- Dashboard Design
- Data Analysis

